freococo/myanmar_asr
Burmese (Myanmar) speech recognition, a 23.8M-parameter Conformer CTC model trained from scratch.
https://huggingface.co/freococo/myanmar_asr (revision e40d48e354f6ee1b8e15e4fc513cfba7d624e80a)
License: Apache License 2.0, as declared by the model card (LICENSE).

Modification notice: BudgetWise converted the published weights to one ONNX file (freococo.onnx) with
apps/android/asr/host/export/freococo_onnx.py. The log-mel front end and CMVN statistics are folded into the
graph and the graph returns the argmax syllable ids. The weights are unchanged. vocab.json is the
published file, unmodified. No endorsement by the author is implied.
